{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1349","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Orac and LCM"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the multiset of positive integers $$$s=\\{s_1,s_2,\\dots,s_k\\}$$$, define the Greatest Common Divisor (GCD) and Least Common Multiple (LCM) of $$$s$$$ as follow:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\gcd(s)$$$ is the maximum positive integer $$$x$$$, such that all integers in $$$s$$$ are divisible on $$$x$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\textrm{lcm}(s)$$$ is the minimum positive integer $$$x$$$, that divisible on all integers from $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, $$$\\gcd(\\{8,12\\})=4,\\gcd(\\{12,18,6\\})=6$$$ and $$$\\textrm{lcm}(\\{4,6\\})=12$$$. Note that for any positive integer $$$x$$$, $$$\\gcd(\\{x\\})=\\textrm{lcm}(\\{x\\})=x$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Orac has a sequence $$$a$$$ with length $$$n$$$. He come up with the multiset $$$t=\\{\\textrm{lcm}(\\{a_i,a_j\\})\\ |\\ i \\lt j\\}$$$, and asked you to find the value of $$$\\gcd(t)$$$ for him. In other words, you need to calculate the GCD of LCMs of all pairs of elements in the given sequence."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$n\\ (2\\le n\\le 100\\,000)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers, $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq a_i \\leq 200\\,000$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer: $$$\\gcd(\\{\\textrm{lcm}(\\{a_i,a_j\\})\\ |\\ i \\lt j\\})$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n1 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n10 24 40 80\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n40\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10\n540 648 810 648 720 540 594 864 972 648\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n54\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first example, $$$t=\\{\\textrm{lcm}(\\{1,1\\})\\}=\\{1\\}$$$, so $$$\\gcd(t)=1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the second example, $$$t=\\{120,40,80,120,240,80\\}$$$, and it's not hard to see that $$$\\gcd(t)=40$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1349A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1349/problem/A"}